{"sourceUrl":"https://ifsr.nufe.edu.cn/info/1029/4956.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:46.275486+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ifsr.nufe.edu.cn/info/1029/4956.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>粮食和物资学院</span></span><strong><span><span>应用经济学专业</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>（学术学位）</span></span></strong><span><span>拟接收推荐免试硕士研究生</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>热忱</span></span><span><span>欢迎各</span></span><span><span>高</span></span><span><span>校优秀学子踊跃报名！</span></span> </p>\n<p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>导师</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>队伍</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>和研究生培养</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>请参阅南京财经大学粮食和物资学院网站</span><span>“人才培养”栏目（</span></span><a href=\"http://ifsr.nufe.edu.cn/rcpy/ssyjspy.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>http://ifsr.nufe.edu.cn/rcpy/ssyjspy.htm</span></span></a><span><span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>方式和报名时间</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>拟申请免试攻读南京财经大学</span><span>2027</span><span>年研究生的优秀应届本科毕业生，可登录“南京财经大学研究生推免系统”（</span><span><a href=\"http://yjs.nufe.edu.cn/gsapp/sys/yjsbmxsd/entrance.do\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">http://yjs.nufe.edu.cn/gsapp/sys/yjsbmxsd/entrance.do</a></span><span>）进行预填报，网上申请时间为：即日起至</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>17</span><span>日</span><span>11</span><span>：</span><span>00</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、申请条件和申请程序</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>请</span></span><span><span>参阅学校研究生院发布的《南京财经大学关于接收</span><span>2027</span><span>年推免生预报名工作的通知》（</span></span><a href=\"https://yjsc.nufe.edu.cn/info/1011/6961.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>https://yjsc.nufe.edu.cn/info/1011/6961.htm</span></span></a><span><span>）。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、支持政策</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学校建立丰富完善的奖助体系，我校推免生就读期间可按我校有关规定申请学业奖学金、国家奖学金、研究生助学金、社会捐赠类奖（助）学金等。具体奖助标准及评定办法根据上级教育主管部门和学校相关文件执行。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>联系方式</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（一）研究生院</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>单位代码：</span><span>10327</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>南京财经大学网址：</span><span>http://www.nufe.edu.cn</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>研究生院网址：</span><span>http://yjsc.nufe.edu.cn</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>研究生院招生管理办公室电子邮箱：</span><span>yzb@nufe.edu.cn</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>研究生院咨询电话：</span><span>025-86718661</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>通讯地址：南京市栖霞区文苑路</span><span>3</span><span>号南京财经大学</span><span>52</span><span>号信箱</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>邮政编码：</span><span>210023</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（二）粮食和物资学院</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学院网址：</span>http://ifsr.nufe.edu.cn/index.htm</span></p>\n<p><span><span>招生咨询电话：</span>025- 86718991</span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系邮箱：</span></span><span><span>9119961041@nufe.edu.cn</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人</span></span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>吴</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>欢迎</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报考南京财经大学</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>粮食和物资学院</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>，期待与您相约南财！</span></span></strong></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"36c3d6844cd7ba024dcd53d2ebcb60a38d10a9d02013d10a50d3